    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "title": "B2 Stylistic Notice",
      "content": "Distinguish between factual condition ('amennyiben bekövetkezik, úgy...') and hypothetical speculation ('amennyiben bekövetkezne, úgy...'). When drafting future tech scenarios, the conditional mood underscores epistemic uncertainty."
