new:
  "title": "Multi-Clause Counterfactual Stacking in Scientific Dilemmas",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Ha ... volna and Its Results",
      "content": "You know the past counterfactual from B1 Unit 39: *ha* + past tense + *volna* in the condition, and *volna* again in the result (*Ha tudtam volna, eljöttem volna*). A past condition can also have a result that holds today (B1 Unit 70): *Ha nem építették volna meg a gyárat, ma nem lenne itt munkahely.* Here several such clauses follow one another, to trace a chain of causes and effects."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Even If It Had Happened",
      "content": "You know *még ha ... is* from B2 Unit 53. With *volna* it grants a condition that did not happen and says the result would have been the same: *Még ha figyelmeztették volna is a tudósokat, akkor sem hallgattak volna rájuk.* The past possibility *meg lehetett volna előzni* ('it could have been prevented') is known from B1 Unit 39 and B2 Unit 15."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Counterfactual Patterns",
      "rows": [
        [
          "ha ... volna, ... volna",
          "Ha időben észrevették volna a hibát, a gép nem romlott volna el. (If they had noticed the error in time, the machine would not have broken down.)"
        ],
        [
          "ha ... volna, ma ... -na/-ne",
          "Ha nem építették volna meg a gyárat, ma nem lenne itt munkahely. (If they had not built the factory, there would be no jobs here today.)"
        ],
        [
          "még ha ... volna is, akkor sem ... volna",
          "Még ha figyelmeztették volna is a tudósokat, akkor sem hallgattak volna rájuk. (Even if they had warned the scientists, they would not have listened to them.)"
        ],
        [
          "meg lehetett volna ...",
          "A balesetet meg lehetett volna előzni. (The accident could have been prevented.)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "examples",
      "title": "Authentic B2 Examples",
      "items": [
        {
          "spanish": "Ha a mérnökök időben észrevették volna a hibát, a gép nem romlott volna el.",
